==== Power consumption ====
Measured with Peaktech P9035 (CS5460A-BSZ) at the wall power plug, the device consumes 6.6W with both WiFis active and three 1 Gigabit Ethernet links established without much traffic. Power consumption increases by 0.2W when changing scaling governor from ''ondemand'' (Idle with 437.5 MHz) to ''performance'' (Idle with 1350 MHz). Peak power consumption of about 10W has been seen loading the device with 50 Mbit/s OpenVPN traffic via Wifi, which loads one CPU core about 30%.

